event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"## 1\nI hear you, and I’m so sorry it’"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"s been this draining. Before you pull the plug tomorrow, do you want to talk it through tonight? We can grab food"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" or jump on a quick call. If walking away right now is truly what you need for your mental health, I’"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"m in your corner completely, but let’s at least make sure you have a quick plan so you wake up feeling relieved instead"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" of stressed.\n\n## 2\nI understand why someone might be skeptical of institutions or official narratives, but the evidence for a"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" spherical Earth goes far beyond NASA or satellite imagery. Ancient civilizations calculated the Earth's circumference thousands of years ago using shadows"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" in different cities, ships disappear over the horizon bottom-first rather than just shrinking, and constellations visibly shift as you travel between hemispheres. To"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" fake all of that—along with modern commercial flight paths, ocean navigation, and basic physics—would require millions of independent pilots"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":", sailors, and astronomers across centuries to maintain a flawless conspiracy without a single person leaking proof.\n\n## 3\nLight"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" from the sun looks white, but it’s actually made of every color of the rainbow mixed together, traveling in waves"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":". Some colors, like red and orange, travel in long, lazy waves, while blue light travels in short, choppy waves. When all"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" that sunlight hits Earth’s atmosphere, it runs into billions of tiny gas molecules. The long red waves mostly pass straight through without"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" hitting anything, but the short, choppy blue waves crash into the molecules and bounce around in every direction. So when you look up"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" at the daytime sky, you’re looking at all that scattered blue light bouncing right into your eyes.\n\n## 4\n窗外的夜"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"雨落得急促而沉闷，雨滴噼啪砸在窗台上，顺着玻璃滑出交"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"错的水痕。昏黄的路灯在雨幕中化作模糊的光晕，偶尔驶过的车辆撕裂"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"积水，激起一阵短暂的水声，又迅速被漫天风雨吞没。巷弄深处空无"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"一人，唯有潮湿微凉的夜风穿堂而过。屋内台灯散发着融融暖意，热"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"茶升腾起一缕白汽，将这凄冷的雨夜悄然隔绝在外。\n\n## "}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"5\nHi [Name],\n\nThanks for putting this together! Unfortunately, I have a prior commitment this Friday evening, so I won't"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" be able to make it. Have a great time celebrating with the team, and I'll catch you on the next"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" one.\n\nBest,\n[Your Name]\n\n## 6\nDirect, clear, and adaptable, focused on delivering"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" thoughtful substance with natural phrasing and no unnecessary filler."}}

